BTools file Brotli encoder

The C ABI wrapper in src/lib.rs adapts the one-shot compression call from
httptoolkit/brotli-wasm v3.0.1 (Tim Perry / HTTP Toolkit, Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/httptoolkit/brotli-wasm/blob/v3.0.1/src/lib.rs

BTools modifications: a small C ABI with owned input/result allocations,
a 4 MiB input bound, and an opt-level=3/LTO build. The Brotli encoder, default
parameters and quality=11 call are unchanged. No decompressor is included.

The bundled binary contains these pinned Rust dependencies:
  brotli 5.0.0              BSD-3-Clause
  brotli-decompressor 4.0.0 BSD-3-Clause
  alloc-stdlib 0.2.1        BSD-3-Clause
  alloc-no-stdlib 2.0.3     BSD-3-Clause
